        "snippet": "HIVE Digital Rockets 34%, T1 Energy Jumps 20% on Aschenbrenner Buzz, but CleanSpark, Riot, CoreWeave Stay Quiet - 24/7 Wall St.\n\nStock Market Live May 20, 2026: S&P 500 (SPY) Ticks Higher Ahead of Nvidia Earnings\n\n# HIVE Digital Rockets 34%, T1 Energy Jumps 20% on Aschenbrenner Buzz, but CleanSpark, Riot, CoreWeave Stay Quiet\n\nBy David Moadel Published May 18, 10:35AM EDT\n\n### Quick Read\n\nHive Digital Technologies (HIVE) surged 34% to $3.60 and T1 Energy (TE) jumped 20% to $6.76 following buzz around Leopold Aschenbrenner’s 13-F filing.\n\nHowever, verified positions in Riot Platforms (RIOT), CleanSpark (CLSK), and CoreWeave (CRWV) remain flat or down, suggesting weak institutional conviction.\n\nTraders are chasing social media speculation around Aschenbrenner’s AI infrastructure bets, but some of his verified purchases in infrastructure plays are sluggish, which indicates that the Hive and T1 Energy rally may be a crowded pair trade rather than a genuine institutional thesis.\n\nThe analys",
